{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgorQxDDsEEQwHTPd3SEw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Okay, so: the page answers it straight away, and the answer is a lot. Right at the top it says \"מה האתר עוד לא מכסה\" and a red box says \"החוקים והכללים לכל המוצרים כאן עוד בבדיקה. עד שייסגרו, האתר לא מחשב אותם.\" Every card has the same red tag, \"לא מחושב\". It's basically a long list of stuff it can't work out yet: gold (ETC, gold via a fund), corporate bonds, ביטוח מנהלים, foreign currency deposits, structured products, REITs, life insurance stuff, annuities and so on. I didn't read all of them. Then right at the bottom there's a different list, \"מה האתר לא משווה ולא עושה\", and those aren't \"not yet\", it's \"never\". No picking stocks, no trading, no ranking by past returns, no buying anything through the site. I'm fairly sure about this. For me the bit that matters is that it won't rank by past performance, which is exactly how I'd pick the Nasdaq. Also nothing in the \"not covered\" list looked like a regular ETF or index thing, so I guess that part is covered? But I didn't check.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top heading and the red box.\n2. The first cards: ETC, LBMA Gold, אג״ח קונצרניות, אגרת בונדס.\n3. Next screen: ארנק מט״ח דיגיטלי, ביטוח חיים משתתף ברווחים, ביטוח מנהלים, היוון קצבה.\n4. Then I scrolled fast and just caught headings: השקעה בזהב דרך קרנות סל, הסדר חוב, מנוטרלת מט״ח, מוצר מובנה, מסלולי האירוע, מענק, ניירות ערך מסחריים, עמלת חליפין, פיקדון מובנה, צמוד דולר, קופת ביטוח, קצבה מוכרת, קרן י׳, קרן להשקעות במקרקעין.\n5. I skipped screens 8 and 9 completely and jumped to the bottom for \"מה האתר לא משווה ולא עושה\".\n\n**What I skipped:** all the green law links with page numbers, the \"מקור ראשי\" dates, the \"חוקים וכללים · 3\" chips, and anything under \"מצב הכיסוי\". I didn't read the long \"כשייסגר: יופיע במדריך…\" line either. It's the same line on every card.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** ETC, אג״ח קונצרניות, אגרת בונדס, ביטוח מנהלים, היוון קצבה, מנוטרלת מט״ח, מוצר מובנה, ני״ע, ניירות ערך מסחריים, קרן י׳, קופת ביטוח, תשלומים פטורים, \"חסום: שאלה פתוחה\", and codes like \"MF-28\" and \"TXA-28\".\n\n**Where I'd have closed it:** around the third screen. It's a wall of identical dark cards full of law names on a phone. The only reason I jumped to the bottom was to find a summary.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- It's huge and repetitive.\n- It reads like a legal document.\n- The cards seem to be in alphabetical order, not by how much they matter to someone like me.\n- There's no short summary up top saying \"is a basic ETF / S&P thing covered, yes or no\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3726,"cache_read_input_tokens":15111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3726},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2b68276-20ba-4b92-8351-15a3857e01e4","uuid":"fe8db2ff-bcb6-4afe-8ab5-986a0851d3e5","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:05:24.816Z","request_id":"req_011CgorQwzpC5dZ5H8seQ2Qa"}
